Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:07.79,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Hazır olunca leziz mi leziz çorbamız,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:14.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,♪ Kayna, kayna, kayna! ♪\N♪ Kayna, kayna, kayna! ♪
